    "patchNotes": {
      "001-pnpm-consent-no-sandbox-evasion.patch": "`npx impeccable` and `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}` paths replaced by the vendored launcher (the file name says pnpm; the launcher is what replaced npx); doctor states what `--fix` will change and waits for consent; the advice to route around a sandboxed shell removed; each changed file carries a modification notice",
